+/// The host's function runs once per run outside a drain, after it is over
+/// (not active, nothing pending): with nothing pushed (the one-cell end),
+/// with a cell pushed, with a cell pending before, with a step pending
+/// before, with a release that pushes only a step (the general loop), and
